('1 Chronicles 16:34', 'Give thanks to the LORD, for he is good! His faithful love endures forever.', 'gratitude', 'NLT'),
('Psalm 69:30', 'Then I will praise God''s name with singing, and I will honor him with thanksgiving.', 'gratitude', 'NLT'),
('Colossians 2:7', 'Let your roots grow down into him, and let your lives be built on him. Then your faith will grow strong in the truth you were taught, and you will overflow with thankfulness.', 'gratitude', 'NLT'),
