-- PROTECTION (18 verses)
('Psalm 91:1-2', 'Those who live in the shelter of the Most High will find rest in the shadow of the Almighty. This I declare about the LORD: He alone is my refuge, my place of safety; he is my God, and I trust him.', 'protection', 'NLT'),
