('Psalm 18:2', 'The LORD is my rock, my fortress, and my savior; my God is my rock, in whom I find protection. He is my shield, the power that saves me, and my place of safety.', 'protection', 'NLT'),
('Psalm 91:11', 'For he will order his angels to protect you wherever you go.', 'protection', 'NLT'),
