('Psalm 144:2', 'He is my loving ally and my fortress, my tower of safety, my rescuer. He is my shield, and I take refuge in him.', 'protection', 'NLT'),
('Psalm 3:3', 'But you, O LORD, are a shield around me; you are my glory, the one who holds my head high.', 'protection', 'NLT'),
('Deuteronomy 33:27', 'The eternal God is your refuge, and his everlasting arms are under you.', 'protection', 'NLT'),
