('Psalm 57:2', 'I cry out to God Most High, to God who will fulfill his purpose for me.', 'purpose', 'NLT'),
('Isaiah 14:27', 'The LORD of Heaven''s Armies has spoken — who can change his plans? When his hand is raised, who can stop him?', 'purpose', 'NLT'),
('Psalm 33:11', 'But the LORD''s plans stand firm forever; his intentions can never be shaken.', 'purpose', 'NLT'),
